---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Pricing - Treeline" description="Treeline is free and open source. The only costs are optional, and paid to third parties.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <header class="mb-10">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4">Treeline is free</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-text-muted)] max-w-2xl">
        There's no account and no subscription. The desktop app, every plugin, CSV import, SQL access, and agent integration are all included.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
        It can be free because of how it's built: your data lives in a local database on your machine, so there's no cloud infrastructure to pay for. It's also <a href="https://github.com/treeline-money/treeline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline">open source</a>, so you can read every line and verify exactly what it does with your data.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Optional costs</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-6">
        Two things are opt-in, and paid to third parties — nothing goes to Treeline:
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Automatic bank sync</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
        Connect your accounts through a data provider:
      </p>
      <ul class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mt-2 ml-4 list-disc space-y-1">
        <li><a href="https://beta-bridge.simplefin.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline">SimpleFIN</a> — ~$1.50/month, US & Canada</li>
        <li><a href="https://www.lunchflow.app/?atp=treeline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline">Lunch Flow</a> — ~$3/month, global (US, Canada, EU, UK, Brazil, Asia)</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mt-2">
        Or skip it — CSV import works with any bank.
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2 mt-8">Self-hosting a hub</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
        Syncing between devices and remote AI access (in beta) run through a <a href="https://docs.treeline.money/remote-access/" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline">hub you host yourself</a>. The software is free; the server is yours, so it costs whatever your server costs.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
        Questions? <a href="https://discord.gg/EcNvBnSft5" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline">Join the Discord</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Final CTA -->
    <section class="mt-16 text-center">
      <a
        href="/download"
        class="inline-block px-5 py-2.5 bg-[var(--color-accent)] text-white font-medium rounded-md hover:bg-[var(--color-accent-muted)] transition-colors"
      >
        Download
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
